      "answer": "(1) $2x^3-5x^2+3$ (2) $2x^3-4x^2-3x+2$ (3) $4x^3-11x^2+3x+7$ (4) $Q=2x+1$, $R=5x+4$",
      "solution": "[서술형 1] 풀이참조\n(1) $2x^3-5x^2+3$\n(2) $2x^3-4x^2-3x+2$\n(3) $4x^3-11x^2+3x+7$\n(4) $2x^3-5x^2+3=(x^2-3x-1)Q+R$\n$=2x(x^2-3x-1)+x^2+2x+3$\n$=2x(x^2-3x-1)+(x^2-3x-1)+5x+4$\n$=(x^2-3x-1)(2x+1)+5x+4$\n따라서, $Q=2x+1$, $R=5x+4$",
      "topic": "",
      "difficulty": ""
