      "answer": "(1) $x(x-1)(x-2)$ (2) $x(x-1)(2x^2-2x+5)$ (3) $9x(x-1)$",
      "solution": "[서술형 4] (1) $x(x-1)(x-2)$ (2) $x(x-1)(2x^2-2x+5)$\n(3) $9x(x-1)$\n(1) $x=0$을 대입하면 $\\{Q(1)\\}^2+\\{Q(0)\\}^2=0$ 이므로\n$Q(1)=0$, $Q(0)=0$\n$x=1$을 대입하면 $\\{Q(2)\\}^2+\\{Q(1)\\}^2=0$ 이므로\n$Q(2)=0$\n따라서, $Q(x)=x(x-1)(x-2)$\n(2) $Q(x)$를 식에 대입하면\n$\\{(x+1)x(x-1)\\}^2+\\{x(x-1)(x-2)\\}^2=x(x-1)P(x)$\n$P(x)=x(x-1)\\{(x+1)^2+(x-2)^2\\}=x(x-1)(2x^2-2x+5)$\n(3) $P(x)=x(x-1)(2x^2-2x+5)$\n$=x(x-1)\\{(x-2)(2x+2)+9\\}$\n$=x(x-1)(x-2)(2x+2)+9x(x-1)$\n따라서, $R(x)=9x(x-1)$",
